-bl-label=\"Menu\"><div class=\"cv-dialog__panel\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-dialog__header\"><h2 id=\"_R_9hbsnqbtb_\" class=\"cv-dialog__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Menu</span></h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"cv-btn cv-btn--ghost cv-dialog__close\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Close</span></button></div><div class=\"cv-dialog__body\"><ul class=\"cv-menu__list\"><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Home</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Adventures</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/explore-caa\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Explore CAA</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link is-current\" href=\"/ask-us\" aria-current=\"page\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ask Us</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/photos\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Photos &amp; Video</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/sign-in\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign in</span></span></a></li></ul></div></div></dialog></div></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"cv-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Questions, answered\"><header class=\"cv-pagehead\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Questions, answered\"><p class=\"cv-pagehead__tag\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ask Us</span></span></p><h1 class=\"cv-h cv-h--1 cv-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Questions, answered</span></h1><p class=\"cv-lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The essentials first. Anything we have not decided yet says so, instead of guessing.</span></p></header><section id=\"search\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--wash\" aria-labelledby=\"search-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Search the site\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__text\"><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h2 id=\"search-title\" class=\"cv-h cv-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Search the site</span></h2></div><form class=\"cv-form cv-form--search\" role=\"search\" method=\"get\" data-bl-k=\"form\" data-bl-form=\"\"><div class=\"cv-field\"><label class=\"cv-label\" for=\"ask-q\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What are you looking for?</span></label><p class=\"cv-hint\" id=\"ask-q-hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">For example: valet, kids, Cindy’s, dress code</span></p><input id=\"ask-q\" class=\"cv-input\" aria-describedby=\"ask-q-hint\" type=\"search\" minlength=\"2\" maxlength=\"200\" name=\"q\" value=\"\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><p class=\"cv-form__actions\"><button class=\"cv-btn cv-btn--primary\" type=\"submit\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Search</span></span></button></p></form></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Frequently asked\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__text\"><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"cv-h cv-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Frequently asked</span></h2></div><div class=\"cv-faq\"><article id=\"when-and-where\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-when-and-where\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"When and where is the wedding?\"><h3 id=\"faq-when-and-where\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">When and where is the wedding?</span></h3><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027, at the Chicago Athletic Association Hotel, 12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60603.</span><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/the-wedding\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"what-time\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-what-time\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What time does it start?\"><h3 id=\"faq-what-time\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What time does it start?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding page will show them with the date they were confirmed.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the ceremony, cocktail hour, and reception times are being confirmed with the planner.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/the-wedding\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"dress-code\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-dress-code\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What should I wear?\"><h3 id=\"faq-dress-code\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What should I wear?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the dress code, in one sentence, with an example outfit.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"kids\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-kids\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can we bring our kids?\"><h3 id=\"faq-kids\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can we bring our kids?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">kid policies and any activities for the 28 children in the family.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"plus-ones\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-plus-ones\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can I bring a plus-one?\"><h3 id=\"faq-plus-ones\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can I bring a plus-one?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your invitation will say who it covers.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">plus-one wording.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"parking\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-parking\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Where do I park?\"><h3 id=\"faq-parking\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where do I park?</span></h3><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The hotel’s valet entrance, parking options, and current rates are kept as dated records on Explore CAA, each with the day we last checked them against the hotel’s own page.</span><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/explore-caa#getting-here\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore CAA</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"weather\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-weather\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What if it rains?\"><h3 id=\"faq-weather\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What if it rains?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The ceremony and reception are indoors at the hotel.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">any outdoor plans for the weekend.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"photos\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-photos\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can I take photos?\"><h3 id=\"faq-photos\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can I take photos?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Two professional photographers and a videographer will be there; the professional galleries arrive after the wedding.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">your photo policy for the ceremony and reception.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/photos\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photos &amp; Video</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"accessibility\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-accessibility\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Is the venue accessible?\"><h3 id=\"faq-accessibility\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Is the venue accessible?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The hotel describes its accessible rooms and features on its own FAQ page; the link and the date we last checked it are on Explore CAA.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">accessibility details for the ceremony and reception rooms once they are chosen.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/explore-caa#getting-here\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore CAA</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"rsvp\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-rsvp\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How do I RSVP?\"><h3 id=\"faq-rsvp\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How do I RSVP?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">You’ll receive an invitation link; from there you pick your name and confirm with a one-time code sent to your email. No account, no password.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the RSVP deadline.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/rsvp\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">RSVP</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"travel\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-travel\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Where should I stay, and how do I get there?\"><h3 id=\"faq-travel\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where should I stay, and how do I get there?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Many of you are travelling in. Travel &amp; Stay will list the hotel block, alternatives, and airports once they are confirmed.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">room-block rate, link, and cutoff.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/travel\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"gifts\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-gifts\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Do you have a registry?\"><h3 id=\"faq-gifts\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Do you have a registry?</span></h3><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your presence is the point. If you’d like to help us with our next adventures, the Gifts page will have the details once we’ve chosen how.</span><p><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"/gifts\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Gifts</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"contact\" class=\"cv-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-contact\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How do I reach you?\"><h3 id=\"faq-contact\" class=\"cv-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How do I reach you?</span></h3><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-faq__a\"><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the best way for guests to reach you or the planner.</span></p></div></div></article></div></div></div></section><section id=\"concierge\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"concierge-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Ask a question\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__text\"><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h2 id=\"concierge-title\" class=\"cv-h cv-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Ask a question</span></h2></div><div class=\"cv-slot cv-slot--open\" id=\"concierge-slot\" data-slot=\"concierge\"><div class=\"cq\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p class=\"cq__intro\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ask a question in your own words. The concierge answers only from what this site knows, shows you the page each fact came from, and says when something is not decided yet.</span></p><p class=\"cq__start\"><button class=\"cq__button\" type=\"button\" data-testid=\"concierge-open\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ask the concierge</span></button></p></div></div></div></div></section></main></div><footer class=\"cv-footer\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"footer\"><div class=\"cv-footer__inner\"><p class=\"cv-footer__names\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler</span></p><p class=\"cv-footer__specimen\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027</span></span><br><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">,</span><!-- --> <a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=12%20S%20Michigan%20Ave%2C%20Chicago%2C%20IL%2060603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60603</span><svg class=\"cv-external\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens Google Maps</span></span></a></p><p class=\"cv-footer__signin\"><a class=\"cv-link cv-link--standalone\" href=\"/sign-in\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sign in</span></a></p><p class=\"cv-footer__rights\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photographs by Brooke Alaina Photography and films by Oakhouse Visuals are shared here for personal, non-commercial viewing.</span></p><ul class=\"cv-footer__print\"><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Directions</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: </span><!-- --><